      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8877195870789867535, guid: 1f6a6789373206e498f996cb54aeedb1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Astrid,\n\nFollowing the recent audit of your radio transmission logs,
        the Office of Astronomical Compliance has determined that you have incurred
        three (3) disciplinary strikes for misuse of communication channels reserved
        exclusively for approved astronomical coordination. [optional]Specifically,
        your decision to contact a fellow astronomer regarding non-critical astral
        identification constitutes a violation of Regulation 7-14b.\n\nPer Directive
        22-e, your full access to Recovery Board\u2013issued astronomical equipment
        is hereby suspended. This suspension will remain in effect until you have
        completed your pending celestial identification assignments to the satisfaction
        of the Recovery Board\u2019s reviewing officers.\n\nIn recognition of your
        prior service, the Board is prepared to grant probational reinstatement of
        equipment privileges once you have successfully completed the mandatory identification
        of designated stellar bodies within the Eridanus constellation. This task
        has been logged to your work docket and will be evaluated with heightened
        scrutiny.\n\nYour cooperation is important for us to so that we may continue
        to map the stars for a greater tomorrow.\n\nBy order of the Recovery Board,\n[Monitor]"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
